 cite5†Data Packs cite6†Shaders cite7†Modpacks cite8†Plugins cite9†Servers L7: \nL8: cite2†Sign in L9: \nL10: cite10†Settings Change theme\nL11: \nL12: cite11†Image: (Sodium) Chloride†cdn.modrinth.com L13: \nL14: # (Sodium) Chloride\nL15: \nL16: Gives Sodium additional Performance and Quality features for a tasteful experience\nL17: \nL18: 18.8M downloads\nL19: \nL20: 494 followers\nL21: \nL22: 18.8M downloads\nL23: \nL24: 494 followers\nL25: \nL26: ## Compatibility\nL27: ### Minecraft: Java Edition\nL28: \nL29: 26.2\nL30: \nL31: 26.1.2\nL32: \nL33: 1.21.11\nL34: \nL35: 1.21.5\nL36: \nL37: 1.21.1\nL38: \nL39: 1.20.4\nL40: \nL41: 1.20.1\nL42: \nL43: 1.19.2\nL44: \nL45: 1.18.2\nL46: \nL47: ### Platforms\nL48: \nL49: Fabric Forge NeoForge\nL50: \nL51: ### Supported environments\nL52: \nL53: Client-side\nL54: \nL55: ## Links\nL56: \nL57: cite12†Report issues†github.com cite13†View source†github.com cite14†Visit wiki†github.com cite15†Join Discord server†discord.gg L58: \nL59: * * *\nL60: \nL61: cite16†Donate on PayPal†paypal.me L62: \nL63: ## Tags\nL64: \nL65: Optimization Utility\nL66: \nL67: ## Creators\nL68: ## Details\nL69: \nL70: Licensed ARR\nL71: \nL72: Published 3 years ago\nL73: \nL74: Updated 3 months ago\nL75: \nL76: cite17†Description cite18†Gallery cite19†Changelog cite20†Versions L77: \nL78: # 🧂 CHLORIDE MOD\nL79: \nL80: Chloride is a performance addon/mod for Sodium that aims to improve the performance of the game and the quality of sodium itself. Offers a lot of features to customize and improve your experience with sodium, making it a tasteful experience (`NaCl`).\nL81: \nL82: # 🔧 FEATURES\nL83: ### ⚡ PERFORMANCE\nL84:   * 🐄 ENTITY DISTANCE CULLING\nL85:     * 📐 Avoid rendering/ticking Entities and Block Entities from far away.\nL86:     * 📋 Features a whitelist, letting important entities (such as ender dragon or ghast)\nL87:     * ✨ Example: `minecraft:bat` culls bats, `alexsmobs:all` culls all Alex's Mobs entities.\nL88:   * [🌿] LEAVES CULLING\nL89:     * 📐 Reduce the number of rendered faces in a group of the same type of leaves\nL90:     * 📋 Features a slider to set how many leaves you want to cull\nL91:   * [👟] FAST MODELS\nL92:     * 📐 Replaces suboptimal animated Chest and Bed (below mc26.2) models to use solid models\nL93:     * 📋 Toggle each individually\nL94:   * [🔦] HIDE JEI/REI/EMI OVERLAY\nL95:     * 📐 Hides JEI/REI/EMI overlays until you type anything in their search bars\nL96:     * ✨ Show a small meessag indicating you must search something to show the overlay\nL97:   * [🌎] FAST LANGUAGE RELOAD\nL98:     * 📐 Reload quick as possible the language (less than 1 second).\nL99:   * [🔁] [26.2] ENGINE HOTSWAP (VK/GL)\nL100:     * 📐 Enables hotswap of rendering engines (GL/VK) in-game.\nL101:     * 📋 Disabled by default, can be enabled, compatible with sodium, incompatible with iris.\nL102:     * ✨ No need to restart the game, perfect to compare instantly the game perf.\nL103: ### 🛠️ VISUAL UTILITY\nL104:   * [🕯️] TRUE DARKNESS\nL105:     * 📐 Adds MANY darkness levels to the game, making it more realistic (and darker)\nL106:     * 📋 Toggles between DIM, DARK, DARKNESS, BLACK and BLACKNESS\nL107:     * ✨ Moonlight and blocklights can affect the darkness level\nL108:   * [🏷️] NAMETAG HIDING\nL109:     * 📐 Removes nametag rendering for everyone like players, entities and item frames. (what's your name?)\nL110:     * 📋 Toggle each individually\nL111:   * [🔍] ZOOM KEY\nL112:     * 📐 Adds a simple immediate zoom key to the game, allowing you to zoom in and out\nL113:     * 📋 Can configure min and max distance and can be disabled\nL114:     * ✨ You can scroll to zoom in and out while zooming\nL115: ### 👓 QUALITY\nL116:   * [🌁] FOG/BLUEBAND SETTINGS\nL117:     * 📐 Configure the distance (start, end), and the visibility of the fog and the blueband.\nL118:     * 📋 Toggle each individually\nL119:   * [🧮] FPS DISPLAY\nL120:     * 📐 Shows your average, min and current FPS, Memory usage percent and GPU usage percent.\nL121:     * ✨ You can place it anywhere on the screen, even above your hotbar\nL122:   * [🖥️] BORDERLESS FULLSCREEN:\nL123:     * 📐 Adds borderless fullscreen to the game, adding quick-tab switching, image-in-imag support and no more black screen\nL124:     * ✨ Fullscreen key (F11) can also switch to Borderless FullScreen (can be disabled or override)\nL125:   * [🔳] TEXT SHADOWS TOGGLE\nL126:     * 📐 Disables font shadows, sometimes increases the FPS on screens with a lot of text\nL127:   * ~~[👁️] CHUNK FADE IN~~\nL128:     * Will be back in future updates\n"
